1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,320
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,760
=The One=

16
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 18=

17
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,920
(Ji Group Charity Gala)

18
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,399
That little detour is over.

19
00:00:35,679 --> 00:00:37,640
Now, let's give a warm round of applause

20
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,039
to Ms. Su

21
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:40,039
as she continues.

22
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:42,479
(Ji Group Charity Gala)
A toast to her courage.

23
00:00:57,159 --> 00:00:58,240
Thank you, everyone.

24
00:00:58,479 --> 00:00:59,479
Thank you, Mr. Ji.

25
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:02,880
As a lawyer,

26
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:05,840
I want every woman to know this:

27
00:01:06,359 --> 00:01:08,239
If someone forces you to have sex

28
00:01:08,239 --> 00:01:10,079
against your will,

29
00:01:10,079 --> 00:01:11,680
whether through violence,

30
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,599
coercion, or any other means,

31
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,640
that's rape.

32
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:19,120
Publicly spreading false claims

33
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,680
is defamation.

34
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:22,840
Six years ago,

35
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,640
I kept all the evidence.

36
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:25,760
Physical evidence.

37
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:27,079
And recordings.

38
00:01:27,519 --> 00:01:28,280
Next,

39
00:01:28,599 --> 00:01:30,719
I'll be suing Professor Ge.

40
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:33,079
He'll answer for what he did

41
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,599
six years ago.

42
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,440
I'll also sue

43
00:01:37,441 --> 00:01:39,040
his daughter, Ge Yao, for defamation.

44
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,040
I hope

45
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:42,400
every woman

46
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,319
who's been hurt

47
00:01:43,319 --> 00:01:44,560
and is afraid to speak up

48
00:01:44,959 --> 00:01:45,959
remembers this:

49
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,680
The shame isn't ours to carry.

50
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,239
It belongs to the abusers.

51
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:54,280
We're not the ones who should be judged.

52
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:56,560
The perpetrators are.

53
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,400
Thank you.

54
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:22,360
Between us,

55
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,599
you never need to say thank you.

56
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:28,000
Thank you, Ms. Su,
for such a courageous opening.

57
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:29,080
I'm announcing today

58
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:30,599
that the Ji Group's

59
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,960
five-year legal counsel contract

60
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:35,560
will go to Ms. Su's firm,

61
00:02:35,879 --> 00:02:36,800
Xincheng Law Firm.

62
00:02:38,599 --> 00:02:41,240
Also, all donations made tonight

63
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,479
will go toward programs

64
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:45,000
supporting women's
and children's rights.

65
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:47,639
And most importantly,

66
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,439
allow me
to introduce my younger brother.

67
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:51,680
Cheng Lin.

68
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,439
My father's youngest son.

69
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,240
Sorry, Su Yan.

70
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,800
I didn't get a chance to tell you.

71
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:08,240
Oh my God.

72
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,120
His youngest son? They do look alike.

73
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:17,719
I kept my promise.

74
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,599
Now it's your turn.

75
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,880
You look a lot like our father.

76
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,440
Your mother...

77
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,040
I called her Madam Cheng.

78
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,760
She used to be our father's secretary.

79
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,480
That's your dad.

80
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,960
He's got nothing to do with me.

81
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,160
Anyway,

82
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:40,560
you're the result of one of
your father's affairs.

83
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:42,560
He doesn't have much time left.

84
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,480
He wants me to bring you home

85
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,960
and take your place in the family.

86
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:48,960
No.

87
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,040
Take your place in the family,

88
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,280
and you'll have it made, kid.

89
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,600
I said no.

90
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,520
My mother raised me on her own.

91
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:01,120
I can take care of her now.

92
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:02,240
Besides,

93
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:06,440
aren't you afraid
I'll fight you for the inheritance?

94
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,400
Of all his illegitimate sons,

95
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,800
you're the one I dislike the least.

96
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,880
I can take you under my wing

97
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,520
as long as you do as I say.

98
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:16,360
Power and status

99
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:17,960
will all be yours.

100
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:19,960
There's one thing I hate:

101
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,600
doing what I'm told.

102
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:23,280
I'm not interested.

103
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,400
I can turn public opinion
around for Ms. Su.

104
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,720
Just follow my lead for a few years.

105
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,440
I'll clear her name completely,

106
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,920
and land her the contract I'm offering.

107
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,480
(Su Yan.)

108
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,480
(Tell me.)

109
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:43,080
(What would make you feel better?)

110
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:46,080
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

111
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:49,600
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

112
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:53,120
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

113
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:56,880
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

114
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:15,360
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

115
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:19,000
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

116
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:22,200
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

117
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:25,880
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

118
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:29,280
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

119
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:32,960
♪I hum this song alone♪

120
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:36,800
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

121
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:40,880
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

122
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:44,160
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

123
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:47,760
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

124
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:51,240
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

125
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:56,120
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
